# OMC session state — machine-local, not project content
.omc/

# Raw research dumps (large; digests are committed instead)
notes/research/*-raw.json

# Scratch
*.bak-*

# Hardware captures. Raw output contains serial numbers, MAC addresses,
# filesystem UUIDs and hostnames.
#
# Deliberately fail-closed: everything here is ignored and the two intended
# committed artifacts are named explicitly. A pattern-match approach (ignoring
# *-raw.md and friends) fails OPEN — a capture saved under an unanticipated
# name would be silently committable, which is the wrong failure direction for
# a privacy rule. Adding a third committed artifact means adding a line here,
# and that is the point.
notes/hardware/*
!notes/hardware/README.md
!notes/hardware/tensorbook-profile.md

# macOS and Python detritus
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
